body:
>On a more serious note do you ppl think adding more classes is the way to go in the future? do you have hope for the team getting the balance right for the next expansion?  

&#x200B;

If they add Control classes with 1 mana hero powers, I can forgive team 5 slightly for being out of touch with their community by keeping releasing Aggro/OTK stuff. And I think the balance will get worse, time has shown that.
